    "concept": {
      "title": "紅葉が星になる",
      "story": "夕方の裏山の広場で、6 匹と並んで座る。紅葉の光が一枚離れ、旋律に合わせて左右から一枚ずつ舞う。小さな山で風が吹き、草の葉がいっせいに舞い上がって観客の後ろから谷へ渡る。後ろの木から葉の流れが頭上を越えてゆるい渦を昇り、谷の上に月が昇るにつれて上ほど色が冷え、渦の上端に光が混じり始める。和声が開く瞬間に葉は白い星の点へ変わって夜空に広がり、終わりの瞬きの音に合わせて星が少しずつ瞬く。最後の一枚が犬のそばに降りて消える。",
      "palette": "primary #FF6A2B (momiji red) / secondary #FFB347 (gold) / cool #B8B4FF (the cooled top of the vortex) / accent #F4F8FF (star white). Colour-changing layers are tint:false.",
      "motifs": [
        "M1 one leaf",
        "M2 leaf per melody note / answer from the other side",
        "M2' one wind wave across the plaza (v2)",
        "M3 streams from the real trees into a rising vortex that cools with height; moonrise + glints at its top (v2)",
        "M4 leaves become star points (one big scatter)",
        "M5 stars remain and twinkle with the figure (v2), last leaf by the dogs"
      ],
      "arc": "one leaf → leaves answer each other → a gust (small crest) → streams → vortex under the rising moon → leaves become stars → night stars twinkle + the last leaf",
      "version": "v2 (演出 002 of the show; v1 = shows/kh-hillside-dusk/versions/001)",
      "avoid": "constellation lines / dipper (kd-quiet-wishes), light flowers / light tree (garden-lights), sakura petals (petal-waltz), paw prints (happy-tails), screen-filling particles, explosions, constant maximum"
    },
